# Goal
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped target_pose   # Desired end‐effector pose
float64 stop_height                     # Meters above the object to stop
---
# Result
bool success                            # True if pose reached within tolerance
string message                          # Optional status or error description
---
# Feedback
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped current_pose  # Current end‐effector pose during motion